[2.436268, "o", "\u001b[90mUsing ratios:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90m  the limit is at least 2.0x the slowest accepted solution (acToTimeLimit)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90m  and every solution expected to be too slow must take at least 1.5x the limit, checked afterwards \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90m(timeLimitToTle)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90m  rounded up to a multiple of 100 ms (timeResolution)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90m  the accepted solutions run capped at 10000 ms (inferenceTimeout)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
